# Homebrew baseline for every macOS machine. List leaf packages only; brew installs their dependencies.
# A private chezmoi source adds entries in ~/.local/share/chezmoi-private/Brewfile and drops public ones listed in
# Brewfile.skip (legcord and opencode on the work machine); the brew-bundle script merges them.

